"hero": "\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\">{{ppp:breadcrumbs}}<span class=\"eyebrow\">{{ppp:shared:business.name:html}} · Perth</span><h1>Switchboard Repairs &amp; Upgrades Perth</h1><p class=\"expanded-lead\">Switchboard repairs and upgrades in Perth, following assessment of the existing installation, reported faults and proposed loads. We explain the findings and quote for the agreed scope rather than assuming every older board needs full replacement.</p><p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:{{ppp:shared:business.localTelephone:html}}\">Call {{ppp:shared:business.displayTelephone:html}}</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=switchboard-upgrades-perth.html\">Arrange a visit &amp; quote</a></p><p class=\"expanded-hours\">{{ppp:shared:hours.text:html}}</p><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"expanded-toc\"><a href=\"#service-scope\">Service scope</a><a href=\"#service-scenarios\">Common situations</a><a href=\"#service-quote\">Process &amp; quote</a><a href=\"#service-faq\">FAQs</a></nav></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"sections": [
{
"id": "section-1",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scope\">Switchboard upgrades: service scope</h2><ul><li>Assess switchboard faults and proposed upgrade requirements.</li><li>Quote for the agreed board, protection devices, circuit work and testing.</li><li>Identify supply coordination, access, interruptions and required documentation for the actual work.</li><li>Whole-house rewiring, utility works and remediation of unidentified concealed faults are not automatically included in a board upgrade.</li></ul><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"electrical.html\">electrical services</a></li><li><a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">Fault finding before equipment replacement</a></li><li><a href=\"safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">Safety switch faults</a></li><li><a href=\"rcd-testing-perth.html\">RCD testing and findings</a></li><li><a href=\"power-points-perth.html\">New outlet requirements</a></li><li><a href=\"service-areas.html\">service regions</a></li></ul></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-2",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section expanded-scenarios\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scenarios\">Switchboard faults, recurring trips and planned upgrades</h2><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>An older fuse board and new kitchen appliances</h3><p>You are adding equipment to a home with an older board. Describe the proposed appliances and existing concerns without opening the board. Capacity, protection and connection requirements need assessment; the age or appearance alone does not define the required upgrade.</p></div><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>Repeated trips or signs of damage</h3><p>A trip may arise from a circuit or connected equipment rather than a failed switchboard. An upgrade is not a substitute for fault finding. Burning, sparking, smoke or shock needs safety-first action, not repeated attempts to reset devices.</p></div></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-3",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-quote\">Switchboard equipment, circuit scope and upgrade quote</h2><p>The proposed switchboard work is assessed against the existing board, protection devices, circuits and any planned equipment changes. An older fuse board and a recurring trip are different starting points: the reported fault may need investigation before the upgrade scope can be settled. New appliances do not by themselves establish which board or circuit work is required.</p><p>The quote identifies the board and devices included, circuit work, testing, access and expected supply interruptions. Supply coordination and documentation are agreed for the actual job. The completed work and any further findings are explained after the authorised checks. Unidentified concealed faults, utility work and whole-house rewiring are not automatically included in a switchboard upgrade.</p><p>Published guide ranges cover standard-hours, standard-scope work. Your written quote confirms attendance, investigation, materials and the agreed work. Emergency repair charges follow the quoted plan.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "service-faq",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq\" id=\"service-faq\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Switchboard Repairs &amp; Upgrades service guidance</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"electrical.html\">electrical services</a></li><li><a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">Fault finding before equipment replacement</a></li><li><a href=\"safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">Safety switch faults</a></li><li><a href=\"rcd-testing-perth.html\">RCD testing and findings</a></li><li><a href=\"power-points-perth.html\">New outlet requirements</a></li></ul></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><div class=\"service-information\"><h3>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</h3>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</div><div class=\"service-information\"><h3>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</h3>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</div><p class=\"related-faq-link\"><a href=\"faq.html#electrical\">Read related electrical answers</a></p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"items": [
{
"question": "When does an older switchboard need repair or replacement?",
"answer": "<p>Condition, faults, the existing protection and proposed electrical work guide that decision. An older board needs professional assessment, not an automatic full-replacement claim based on age alone.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can I get an itemised quote before approving an upgrade?",
"answer": "<p>Yes. The written scope identifies the proposed equipment and work, testing, any supply coordination and additional work requiring approval. Confirm inclusions before proceeding.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Switchboard upgrade costs and written scope",
"answer": "<p>Cost depends on the assessed installation, equipment, circuit work, access and supply arrangements. We quote for that scope; no single price is assumed to cover every board or property.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Recurring circuit trips and switchboard work",
"answer": "<p>Not necessarily. The cause may lie in connected equipment or a circuit. Investigation should establish the fault before an upgrade is presented as the solution.</p>" as TrustedHtml
}
]
},
{
"id": "section-5",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section contact-band\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Arrange switchboard repairs &amp; upgrades</h2><p>Send the property location, a brief description, proposed product details where relevant, access contact and approval requirements. For a rental, coordinate the request with the owner or managing agent. The appointment and work are agreed with you rather than reserved by submitting a form.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:{{ppp:shared:business.localTelephone:html}}\">Call {{ppp:shared:business.displayTelephone:html}}</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=switchboard-upgrades-perth.html\">Request an assessment &amp; written quote</a><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"property-management.html\">Property-manager approvals and access</a></li><li><a href=\"faq.html\">Booking and quotation FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"about.html\">About {{ppp:shared:business.name:html}}</a></li></ul></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
}
